  "courseSlug": "vuejs-2-the-complete-guide",
  "courseTitle": "Vue - The Complete Guide (incl. Router & Composition API)",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "21526496",
      "title": "Handling Technical / Browser-side Errors",
      "lectureOrder": 163,
      "videoOrder": 141,
      "sourceHash": "585bb6fc11d2405cdcf9bdd991e9522551d7f66eace5213d599c6855b568187e",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.34,
          "end": 5.31,
          "en": "For that, let me show you how a real error",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.31,
          "end": 6.76,
          "en": "could occur here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.76,
          "end": 9.64,
          "en": "We can simply manipulate this URL.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.64,
          "end": 11.28,
          "en": "Of course, that is an error",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.28,
          "end": 13.24,
          "en": "you typically would be able to avoid",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 13.24,
          "end": 16.093,
          "en": "because you as a developer add that URL.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 17.01,
          "end": 19.99,
          "en": "But since I have no influence on the server side code here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 19.99,
          "end": 22.46,
          "en": "I can't fake a server side error.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 22.46,
          "end": 25.22,
          "en": "Hence sending a request to an invalid URL",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 25.22,
          "end": 27.67,
          "en": "is the best thing I can do right now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 27.67,
          "end": 29.623,
          "en": "Let's remove dot .json at the end.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 30.8,
          "end": 33.14,
          "en": "This is something Firebase doesn't like,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 33.14,
          "end": 36.29,
          "en": "and if you then send the request to this invalid URL,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 36.29,
          "end": 39.273,
          "en": "Firebase will respond with an error message.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 40.69,
          "end": 45.69,
          "en": "So let's save that and reload and everything is red.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 45.74,
          "end": 48.673,
          "en": "We see a bunch of red, so clearly this failed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 51.3,
          "end": 53.16,
          "en": "We can handle such errors,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 53.16,
          "end": 56.89,
          "en": "which in this case actually is thrown by the browser here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 56.89,
          "end": 60.67,
          "en": "We can handle such errors by adding another block",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 60.67,
          "end": 62.87,
          "en": "in our then chain.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 62.87,
          "end": 66.77,
          "en": "After all those then blocks, we can add a catch method.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 66.77,
          "end": 71.203,
          "en": "So .catch on this long chain of thens and thens.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 72.61,
          "end": 77.25,
          "en": "Catch all the works on promises and it takes a function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 77.25,
          "end": 79.24,
          "en": "I'll also use an arrow function here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 79.24,
          "end": 82.8,
          "en": "which will be triggered whenever any error occurs",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 82.8,
          "end": 85.17,
          "en": "related to the previous, then blocks.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 85.17,
          "end": 87.74,
          "en": "So related to the original request",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 87.74,
          "end": 90.583,
          "en": "or thrown in a later then block.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 91.81,
          "end": 95.22999999999999,
          "en": "Here, we'll get the error and here we can handle it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 95.22999999999999,
          "end": 96.15,
          "en": "So here for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 96.15,
          "end": 99.083,
          "en": "we can console log the error to get started.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 100.55,
          "end": 104.143,
          "en": "If I do that and reload, here that's my console log.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 105.75999999999999,
          "end": 108.16,
          "en": "Of course, I'm not here to just log it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 108.16,
          "end": 111.2,
          "en": "So instead, I wanna show something to the user",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 111.2,
          "end": 112.24000000000001,
          "en": "on the screen,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 112.24000000000001,
          "end": 115.41,
          "en": "because typically your users are not going to open",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 115.41,
          "end": 116.74000000000001,
          "en": "the developer tools.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 116.74000000000001,
          "end": 119.78399999999999,
          "en": "So they just see loading and they are wondering",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 119.78399999999999,
          "end": 123.76,
          "en": "whether they will eventually see some data or not.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 123.76,
          "end": 126.864,
          "en": "So I wanna improve this experience and show an actual",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 126.864,
          "end": 128.984,
          "en": "error message to the user,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 128.984,
          "end": 132.35,
          "en": "either a dialogue or in my case here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 132.35,
          "end": 134.033,
          "en": "simply a message down there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 134.87,
          "end": 138.77,
          "en": "And for that, we can simply manage another data property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 138.77,
          "end": 141.723,
          "en": "in the component where we are sending the request.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 142.9,
          "end": 146.25,
          "en": "The error property for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 146.25,
          "end": 148.95,
          "en": "the name is up to you though, doesn't have to be error.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 148.95,
          "end": 150.853,
          "en": "Like for all those properties.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 152.01,
          "end": 153.8,
          "en": "Initially, I'll set it to null",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 153.8,
          "end": 156.20499999999998,
          "en": "because initially we have no error,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 156.20499999999998,
          "end": 159.44,
          "en": "but down here we do have an error.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 159.44,
          "end": 161.9,
          "en": "So here I'll set this error equal to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 162.877,
          "end": 167.877,
          "en": "\"Failed to fetch data - please try again later.\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 169.77,
          "end": 173.57,
          "en": "Of course you could also analyze this error object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 173.57,
          "end": 176.98,
          "en": "which we're getting and see if you got more detailed steer",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 176.98,
          "end": 180.483,
          "en": "and show a more specific error message to your users.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 181.33,
          "end": 183.8,
          "en": "That really depends on your application,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 183.8,
          "end": 186.823,
          "en": "which kind of errors you wanna handle and so on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 187.76,
          "end": 190.56,
          "en": "But this at least is a generic error message",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 190.56,
          "end": 193.163,
          "en": "that tells the user that something went wrong.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 194.62,
          "end": 199.583,
          "en": "So here I now wanna use error to show an error message.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 201.79,
          "end": 205.17000000000002,
          "en": "For that I'll add another paragraph here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 206.21,
          "end": 211.02,
          "en": "with v-else-if in that long block of v-else statements",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 211.02,
          "end": 213.41,
          "en": "and check if we're not loading,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 213.41,
          "end": 214.96,
          "en": "because of course if we're loading,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 214.96,
          "end": 217.27,
          "en": "I definitely don't wanna show the error message,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 217.27,
          "end": 219.323,
          "en": "and if I have an error.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 220.19,
          "end": 223.32999999999998,
          "en": "And if I do, I simply output the error here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 223.32999999999998,
          "end": 228.03,
          "en": "because error is simply set to a string here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 228.03,
          "end": 230.723,
          "en": "so of course we can't just output it in our template.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 232.32,
          "end": 235.28,
          "en": "And now we can also use v-else here in the end,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 235.28,
          "end": 238.27,
          "en": "because we know if we reach that block here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 238.27,
          "end": 240.32,
          "en": "we will have results which we can output,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 240.32,
          "end": 242.179,
          "en": "because we're handling all our cases",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 242.179,
          "end": 245.573,
          "en": "before we handle this case here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 248.03,
          "end": 250.33,
          "en": "Of course, I also wanna reset error",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 250.33,
          "end": 252.16,
          "en": "whenever we send a new request.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 252.16,
          "end": 254.86,
          "en": "So when we start sending a new request here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 254.86,
          "end": 256.6,
          "en": "when we set isLoading to true,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 256.6,
          "end": 258.89,
          "en": "I'll also set error back to null,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 258.89,
          "end": 261.163,
          "en": "to reset the error at this point.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 262.08,
          "end": 263.263,
          "en": "And now with that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 267.16,
          "end": 271.69,
          "en": "my project here complains that this error argument",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 271.69,
          "end": 274.78,
          "en": "is never getting used so we'll console log it here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 276.9,
          "end": 277.97,
          "en": "like this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 277.97,
          "end": 280.87,
          "en": "alternatively, we simply leave that blank,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 280.87,
          "end": 283.89,
          "en": "but I wanna show you that you would get this error object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 283.89,
          "end": 286.31,
          "en": "that was thrown as an error here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 286.31,
          "end": 290.02,
          "en": "And therefore with that, if I reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 290.02,
          "end": 292.063,
          "en": "we still see a loading.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 296.12,
          "end": 297.633,
          "en": "Let me check why?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 298.54,
          "end": 300.38,
          "en": "Oh yeah, because of course here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 300.38,
          "end": 303.23,
          "en": "I'm just checking if we're loading, and if we are,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 303.23,
          "end": 305.33,
          "en": "I'm always setting loading.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 305.33,
          "end": 308.53,
          "en": "Now the problem is we are loading if we get an error,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 308.53,
          "end": 311.14,
          "en": "because we only set isLoading to false",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 311.14,
          "end": 313.36,
          "en": "if we're able to read some data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 313.36,
          "end": 315.913,
          "en": "which is not happening here, if we catch an error.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 318.66,
          "end": 322.23,
          "en": "So of course we should set this isLoading to false here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 322.23,
          "end": 324.05,
          "en": "in the error case as well,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 324.05,
          "end": 326.283,
          "en": "because we are not loading anymore.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 327.31,
          "end": 330.44,
          "en": "We were unsuccessful, but we're not loading anymore.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 330.44,
          "end": 333.61,
          "en": "So we need to reset this here as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 333.61,
          "end": 337.7,
          "en": "But I also noticed another issue, the order here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 337.7,
          "end": 339.02,
          "en": "We're checking if we're loading,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 339.02,
          "end": 341.42,
          "en": "but they're afterward checking if we're not loading,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 341.42,
          "end": 344.2,
          "en": "but then if we maybe got no result data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 344.2,
          "end": 348.49,
          "en": "and if that's the case, we'll show our no data message.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 348.49,
          "end": 350.69,
          "en": "Actually I wanna switch the order",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 350.69,
          "end": 353,
          "en": "and first check if we have an error,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 353,
          "end": 355.9,
          "en": "so that this overrides the no data case,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 355.9,
          "end": 357.61,
          "en": "and we show the error message",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 357.61,
          "end": 360.713,
          "en": "instead of the no data message if we have an error.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 362.7,
          "end": 365.15,
          "en": "So with all that, let's save that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 365.15,
          "end": 366.07,
          "en": "and now if a reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 366.07,
          "end": 368.793,
          "en": "we see this \"Failed to fetch data\" message here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 370.57,
          "end": 373.57,
          "en": "On the other hand, if we do fix this URL here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 373.57,
          "end": 375.483,
          "en": "if I add .json,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 377.84,
          "end": 379.16,
          "en": "then you see if I reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 379.16,
          "end": 382.053,
          "en": "the data gets loaded and displayed correctly again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 383.19,
          "end": 387.24,
          "en": "And if I delete my data here, let's check this case as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 387.24,
          "end": 390.573,
          "en": "If I now load the data, we see the no data message.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 391.91,
          "end": 393.51,
          "en": "And if I add data again",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 394.98,
          "end": 397.11,
          "en": "and then load it, that works.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 397.11,
          "end": 399.803,
          "en": "So now this is also how we can handle errors.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
